{
  "note": "Cards that are in print but absent from the Riftcodex dataset, added to cards.json by `rb download-cards`. Riftcodex keeps organized-play promos in the OPP set, numbered with the size of the set they reprint, but has ingested none for Vendetta: OPP carries -298, -221, -219 and -024 promos and no -166 ones at all. The cards below are filed the way Riftcodex would file them, so that a download can tell when it has caught up: download-cards refuses to merge any entry whose set, card name and reprinted-set number have appeared in the dump, whatever id Riftcodex gives it. Delete an entry once that happens — the download fails until you do. Game data is copied from each card's Vendetta printing; only the identifiers, set, rarity and name differ, and no image is published for these printings. Seven of the reported 25-card Nexus Night cycle are confirmed; the rest are not yet documented well enough to add.",
  "sources": [
    "https://riftcompare.com/blog/riftbound-vendetta-nexus-night-promo-cards",
    "https://riftbound.gg/cards/ven-069b-p-mel-newly-awakened-vendetta-nexus-night-promo/"
  ],
